  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity of South Sudan Audit Chamber</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to strengthen the institutional systems and capaci ty of the South Sudan Audit Chamber and promote accountability in the use of pub lic resources. This is achieved by South-South learning through support from reg ional Supreme Audit Institutions (SAIs); and face-to-face and on-the-job trainin g for the staff. It will ensure effective leverage of limited financial and huma n resources, sharing experience, building sustainable capacity and improving aud it quality.</narrative>
  </description>
